<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Death cannot hold the resurrection life,</l><l>Though all its force against it may combine;</l><l>Death only gives it opportunity</l><l>To show the boundless pow’r of life divine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Death cannot hold the resurrection life,</l><l>The more interred, the more it multiplies;</l><l>All kinds of suff’ring only help it grow</l><l>And fruits of life abundant realize.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Death cannot hold the resurrection life,</l><l>Thru every block and barrier it breaks;</l><l>Conqu’ring the pow’r of darkness and of hell,</l><l>It swallows death and victory partakes.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Death cannot hold the resurrection life,</l><l>All of God’s fulness it will manifest;</l><l>God’s righteousness and holiness it yields,</l><l>His glorious image by it is expressed.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Oh, may I know this resurrection life,</l><l>In every kind of death its pow’r outpoured,</l><l>In my experience ever realize</l><l>This life is nought but Christ my living Lord.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
